  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">CarmaCars field staff: drivers, detailers, and drivers who also detail. You hand cars over, take them back, move them and shoot listing photos. Everything is on your phone. Your jobs are under <b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> in the staff portal; if you also hold another function (Sales, for example), its pages are in the same menu.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your phone, charged, with a data connection (photos and signatures save as you take them)</li><li>The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)</li><li>A car charger and a cloth for the camera lens</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the invitation email on your phone and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">You land on <b class="gd-ui">Today</b>. Next time, sign in at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span> with your Email and Password.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">In your browser&#39;s menu, choose <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. The portal then opens full screen, like an app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, add your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my phone</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">At the top of the page, fill in your Home address and Postal code and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my home address</b>. You need it before you add a rental or earn a commission.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-f